From 0dd632239684a84b04a7606eccd44ec1ff8d5bca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: swarm-inference-lab downstream <downstream@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 20:25:54 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] olmoe shared expert runtime

Downstream Experiment 010 refactor under Apache-2.0. Move native merged-int8 expert loading and execution into one runtime shared by the local engine and native worker, enforce ownership manifests, and add a dedicated native equivalence test.
